  "title": "Total and Reverse Shoulder Arthroplasty",
  "jurisdiction": "Medicare Administrative Contractor (MAC) LCD",
  "effective_date": "2023-01-01",
  "category": "Orthopedic Surgery",
  "description": "Medicare coverage guidelines for anatomic total shoulder arthroplasty (TSA) and reverse total shoulder arthroplasty (RTSA). Requires advanced glenohumeral osteoarthritis, rotator cuff tear arthropathy, severe pain and loss of motion, and failure of at least 3 months of conservative care.",
